{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05373","headline":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤学士赐宴 · 刘昇","name":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤学士赐宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"图书应明主，策府宴嘉宾。\n台曜临东壁，乾光自北辰。\n网罗穷象系，述作究天人。\n圣酒千锺洽，仙厨百味陈。\n成山徒可仰，涉海讵知津。\n幸逢文教盛，还覩颂声新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘昇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05373.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05373","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}